{
    "lesson": 19,
    "title": [
        "The Weather in Beijing",
        "北京的天气"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Beijing is in the northeast of China and has been the capital of the country for over eight centuries.",
                "北京位于中国东北部，作为国家首都已有八百多年历史。"
            ],
            [
                "It attracts millions of tourists from all over the world every year.",
                "它每年吸引来自世界各地的数百万游客。"
            ],
            [
                "If you're looking at the calendar and planning for a trip, please notice the weather in Beijing.",
                "如果你正在查看日历并计划旅行，请留意北京的天气。"
            ],
            [
                "Beijing has four distinct seasons: short windy spring, hot and wet summer, cool and pleasant autumn, and long chilly winter.",
                "北京有四季分明：短暂多风的春天，炎热潮湿的夏天，凉爽宜人的秋天，以及漫长寒冷的冬天。"
            ],
            [
                "The sun in Beijing shines quite often all year round.",
                "北京全年经常阳光明媚。"
            ],
            [
                "Here are the monthly temperatures:",
                "以下是每月的气温："
            ],
            [
                "In spring, the temperature increases rapidly and the weather becomes warm.",
                "春天，气温迅速上升，天气变暖。"
            ],
            [
                "Sometimes the city can be covered by yellow dust which comes from the deserts of Mongolia.",
                "有时这座城市会被来自蒙古沙漠的黄沙覆盖。"
            ],
            [
                "It's already as hot as in the middle of summer from the beginning of June and it often rains.",
                "从六月初开始就已经和仲夏一样炎热，而且经常下雨。"
            ],
            [
                "Short and heavy thunderstorms may come suddenly in the afternoon on sunny days.",
                "晴天的下午可能会突然出现短暂而猛烈的雷暴。"
            ],
            [
                "It becomes pleasant in autumn.",
                "秋天变得宜人。"
            ],
            [
                "It is the best time to visit the city, especially in September and October.",
                "这是游览这座城市的最佳时间，尤其是在九月和十月。"
            ],
            [
                "The green leaves on the trees turn red, golden and brown and the colour of the sky is usually bright blue.",
                "树上的绿叶变成红色、金色和棕色，天空通常是明亮的蓝色。"
            ],
            [
                "In winter, the temperature sometimes can drop to -15℃ at midnight.",
                "冬天，午夜时分气温有时会降至零下15摄氏度。"
            ],
            [
                "Cold winds blow from the north.",
                "寒风从北方吹来。"
            ],
            [
                "Although winter is a dry season, sometimes it snows.",
                "虽然冬季是干燥的季节，但有时会下雪。"
            ],
            [
                "Don't be worried that it gets dark too early—many celebrations take place at night during the Spring Festival holiday, which is usually in January or February.",
                "不要担心天黑得太早——春节假期期间（通常在一月或二月）有许多庆祝活动在晚上举行。"
            ]
        ]
    },
